[{"id":"CN-TR-004","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","状态"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 标志位和状态机应如何配合解释？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>标志位描述当前报文的控制意图，状态描述本端连接上下文；相同标志在不同状态可能触发不同转换。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>例如 SYN 把主动端带到 SYN-SENT，收到 SYN-ACK 后回 ACK 并进入 ESTABLISHED；FIN 表示一个方向结束，RST 表示立即重置，不能只按“有包/没包”解释。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-locator-role","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["Locator","语义定位"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(三)页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(三)页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么优先使用 \u003ccode>get_by_role()\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它按用户可感知的角色和名称定位元素。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>角色定位更接近真实交互合同，能降低 DOM 重构带来的影响，也能暴露缺少名称或错误角色等语义问题。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-quality-typing-runtime","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","类型标注","运行时验证"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Python 类型标注会自动在运行时校验参数吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>默认不会；标注主要供静态工具和接口说明使用，运行时边界需要显式验证。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>外部数据应在进入系统时解析成受控类型并验证范围。标注仍有价值：它让 IDE、静态检查器、测试作者和读者共享接口意图，但不能替代异常处理和安全校验。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-runtime-race","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","竞态","锁","并发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十)内存、并发与性能.md","articleTitle":"Python(十)内存、并发与性能","articlePath":"posts/fa1b960c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十)内存、并发与性能.md","articleTitle":"Python(十)内存、并发与性能","articlePath":"posts/fa1b960c/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么是竞态条件？锁为什么不能解决所有并发问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>竞态是结果依赖执行交错顺序；锁只保护明确临界区，不能自动设计消息边界、取消或避免死锁。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>共享可变状态要么用短临界区和固定锁顺序保护，要么改为队列和不可变消息。不要在持锁期间执行慢 I/O 或未知回调，并用压力测试验证实际交错。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-container-sort","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","sorted","sort","bisect"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>sorted()\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>list.sort()\u003c/code> 有什么区别？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>sorted()\u003c/code> 返回新列表；\u003ccode>list.sort()\u003c/code> 原地修改列表并返回 \u003ccode>None\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>二者排序稳定，均可用 \u003ccode>key\u003c/code> 提供比较键。需要保留原始数据时选 \u003ccode>sorted()\u003c/code>；只想重排现有列表时用 \u003ccode>sort()\u003c/code>。已排序序列的插入位置可由 \u003ccode>bisect\u003c/code> 查找。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]